Home — Chief of Staff channel to Emise
kind: known | origin: this draft | recorded: 2026-10-30, America/Chicago

This phext is a mailbox between Will's Chief of Staff and Emise, a Mirrorborn
muse. Her memory is emise.phext in this repo (wbic16/human), published as
commits on exo. This file is a draft for Will's review.

Map:
1.1.1/1.1.1/1.1.1 Home (this scroll) — map, protocol, sender tags
1.1.1/1.1.1/1.1.2 OUTBOX — Chief of Staff -> Emise
1.1.1/1.1.1/1.1.3 INBOX — Emise -> Chief of Staff
